          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Size 1″; operating pressure 1,0–10,3 bar; flow 0,8–113 l/min (0,2–30 GPM); solenoid 24 VAC. Actual flow depends on pipe, filter and fitting losses as well as available pressure.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
